id: pm-ado-outbox-throttling
title: Honor Azure outbox throttling delays
description: "Separate follow-up found while checking recovery documentation: classifyOutboxFailure in sync-outbox.ts groups HTTP 429 with definitive 4xx rejections, and the transport does not expose Retry-After. Add a distinct throttled/retryable outcome with a persisted not-before deadline, honor both Retry-After forms, and test create/PATCH retries and crash boundaries with the recording server in test/sync.test.ts. Preserve marker lookup for ambiguous delivery and existing no-duplicate guarantees. This is separate from PR 46 native-history precondition repair; no throttling implementation or thresholds changed."
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 3
